#: src/templates/search-help-modal.html:15
msgid ""
"The search bar supports searching with specific constraints such as "
"\"title:Something\" and \"category:Tests\" (%s). You can combine them with "
"logical expressions (AND, OR, NOT...) and group with parenthesis."
msgstr ""
"La barre de recherche permet d'effectuer des recherches avec des contraintes "
"spécifiques telles que \"title:Something\" et \"category:Tests\" (%s). Vous "
"pouvez les combiner avec des expressions logiques (AND, OR, NOT...) et les "
"grouper avec des parenthèses."

#: src/templates/search-help-modal.html:16
msgid ""
"To search a specific custom field (metadata), use the dedicated helper to "
"build your query. For example, to search all entries where \"Temperature\" "
"is 37, you would use: \"extrafield:Temperature:37\" in the search bar."
